ion>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Wide Corner Conveyor</strong> is a structure that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It is a wider version of <a href=\"/wiki/Corner_Conveyor\" title=\"Corner Conveyor\">Corner Conveyor</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Functionality\">Functionality</span></h2>\n<p>While otherwise identical to a Corner Conveyor, the Wide Corner Conveyor can also serve the unique purpose of an adaptor to go between wide sections of conveyor belts and standard width conveyor belts. This is useful for dealing with late-game resources which tend to require the use of wide conveyor belts to avoid jamming.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163803\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 456/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019468/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.410      1 -total\n 90.64%   34.816      1 Template:Objects\n  9.14%    3.511      1 Template:Removed\n  4.51%    1.733      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:966-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163803 and revision id 11467. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Removed","Structures","Conveyors"],"links":[{"title":"Corner Conveyor","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Wide_Corner_Conveyor.png","Wide_Corner_Conveyor_b